ity to exist.\n\nWant to learn more about the Foundation, and get some special in-game perks? Join our group! https://www.roblox.com/groups/2760782/SCPF\n\nGame Rules: https://devforum.roblox.com/t/3551820","path":"/game/1581113210-area-47-roleplay","slug":"1581113210-area-47-roleplay","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ca36b48dfb810bf90d452bbba832832b16da0a9476696828c904ba5d1801d9cb.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-503bf5bf94fd92b8a5e1d440fb8cab45/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":3,"visitor":66166781,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-03-21T22:57:51.064Z","creator":{"name":"Special Containment Procedures Foundation [SCPF]","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":6494527314,"name":"Escape Easy ADMIN Obby","desc":"⭐ Welcome to Easy Admin Obby\n🌟 A fun rainbow obstacle course!\n\n🏆 Winners get free admin and many other cool prizes! \n","path":"/game/6494527314-escape-easy-admin-obby","slug":"6494527314-escape-easy-admin-obby","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e3134032524e6efd70e7223cc1a430763a08ff3e84165ab6a67f3f2e02b8a2ff.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-160753a7703765b960bfa110f4a54f69/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":3,"visitor":511899602,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-07-25T15:00:35.638Z","creator":{"name":"Splashy Studio","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":6776605391,"name":"Accurate Piggy RP: The Reborn","desc":"","path":"/game/6776605391-accurate-piggy-rp-the-reborn","slug":"6776605391-accurate-piggy-rp-the-reborn","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d0a3a9b2ba8ee21b0e9d6d6ae35476b131a641aad3677549cd794e3e88631aa1.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-bffe118cebc1bdb46f1d2720bbc7ac83/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":3,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":null,"creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":0,"freeCount":0,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id"